  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בִּרְכַּת צַדִּיק<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּקֵּשׁ - דְּרֹשׁ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֳמָרָיו יָפִיק<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּכֹבֶד רֹאשׁ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוּא נִתָּן כָּאן<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲבָל נַפְשׁוֹ בָּעֶלְיוֹן.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוּא שֻׁלַּח לְכָאן<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְהַחֲיוֹת דַּל וְאֶבְיוֹן.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁאַתָּה מְבַקֵּשׁ בְּרָכָה - אַל תְּחַפֵּשׂ נֵס, חַפֵּשׂ כְּלִי.<br data-end=\"223\" data-start=\"220\" />\nהַבְּרָכָה מֻעֲנֶקֶת מִלְמַעְלָה, אֲבָל נִשְׁפֶּכֶת רַק לְתוֹךְ לֵב פָּתוּחַ וְעַנָּו.</span></p><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִי שֶׁמְּבַקֵּשׁ בְּרָכָה לְעַצְמוֹ - נִשְׁאַר יָחִיד; מִי שֶׁמְּבָרֵךְ אֲחֵרִים - נִתְבָּרֵךְ עִמָּהֶם</span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><span data-end=\"83\" data-start=\"67\">\"וְרֹב דָּגָן\" = 265 = \"מוֹדִים אֲנַחְנוּ לָךְ\"<br /></span>הַהוֹדָיָה - מַפְתֵּחַ הַבְּרָכָה</p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>'</span><span><b>מַטְעַמִּים</b>' / '</span><span><b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">תַּבְשִׁילִין</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ מאכל טעים - מבושל</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">חָלָק</b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">שְׁעִיעַ</b>'</span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;ללא שערות - מגולח למשעי</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">מִי</b>' / '<b>מַאן</b>'</span><br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ מישהו - מאן דהו</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">צְעָקָה</b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">צִוְחָא</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;צרחה - צווחה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">יִפָּרֵדוּ</b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">יִתְפָּרְשָׁן</b>'</span><br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ יתנתקו - יפרשו זה מזה</span></li></ol><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiC26RgnAmEkKDXSW3CJcqzyOsw2DmP0we3VEHWMq7Fvvxo9jD0EjHd_jAVhMiq2pXc3oRBzcykJsMwtbG-GdwQhTxdexglo7NWSp8xWdJQbiNQeeddEXyj4R-yk3hpa_ePQNUK8gsnAcw6qgqIDs-oRLUvIVz1AyvZPTpiD6LEeUsp9dcHQTKH15knguQ/s1024/ChatGPT%20Image%20Oct%208,%202025,%2001_41_15%20PM.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"פתק קטן תחוב בין אבני הכותל המערבי, ועליו כתוב בכתב יד עברי ברור: &quot;תודה השם&quot;\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiC26RgnAmEkKDXSW3CJcqzyOsw2DmP0we3VEHWMq7Fvvxo9jD0EjHd_jAVhMiq2pXc3oRBzcykJsMwtbG-GdwQhTxdexglo7NWSp8xWdJQbiNQeeddEXyj4R-yk3hpa_ePQNUK8gsnAcw6qgqIDs-oRLUvIVz1AyvZPTpiD6LEeUsp9dcHQTKH15knguQ/w200-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Oct%208,%202025,%2001_41_15%20PM.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div></span></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;לֹא רַק לְבַקֵּשׁ - גַּם לְהוֹדוֹת</span></div></div></div>"
